    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">25 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Binary search</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Rotated array</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/search-in-rotated-sorted-array/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 33</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Search in Rotated Sorted Array</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">A rotation leaves exactly one \"drop\", so every midpoint splits the range into one half that is fully sorted and one that holds the drop. Check whether the target fits the sorted half's [first, last] range; keep that half or the other one. One binary search, O(log n) time, O(1) space.</p>\n"
